#: core/templates/core/about.html:4
msgid "Project Eureka — About Us"
msgstr "尤里卡计划 — 关于我们"

#: core/templates/core/about.html:10 core/templates/core/faq.html:102
msgid "About us"
msgstr "关于我们"

#: core/templates/core/about.html:11
msgid "The people behind the"
msgstr "背后的人"

#: core/templates/core/about.html:11
msgid "eureka."
msgstr "尤里卡。"

#: core/templates/core/about.html:13
msgid ""
"We're a small group of teachers, students, and organisers who believe "
"learning shouldn't stop at a border."
msgstr "我们是由教师、学生和组织者组成的一小群人，他们相信学习不应该止步于国界。"

#: core/templates/core/about.html:14
msgid "This is our story so far — and how you can join it."
msgstr "这是我们迄今为止的故事——以及您如何加入它。"

#: core/templates/core/about.html:49
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "Our vision"
msgid "Our story"
msgstr "我们的故事"

#: core/templates/core/about.html:51
msgid ""
"Project Eureka began at a kitchen table in 2023, with one teacher, one "
"student, and a stack of borrowed textbooks."
msgstr "尤里卡计划于 2023 年在厨房的餐桌上启动，当时只有一名老师、一名学生和一堆借来的教科书。"

#: core/templates/core/about.html:52
msgid ""
"What started as weekly lessons for a single family has grown into a global "
"volunteer community — but the spirit is the same."
msgstr "最初是为一个家庭提供每周一次的课程，现已发展成为一个全球志愿者社区——但精神是一样的。"

#: core/templates/core/about.html:55
msgid ""
"Every classroom we've built stands on the shoulders of the last. Every "
"lesson plan has been rewritten by the teacher who came after."
msgstr "我们建造的每一间教室都站在前一教室的肩膀上。每个教案都被后来的老师重写了。"

#: core/templates/core/about.html:56
msgid "That collaboration is the whole point."
msgstr "这种合作才是重点。"

#: core/templates/core/about.html:65
msgid "The kitchen table"
msgstr "厨房的桌子"

#: core/templates/core/about.html:66
msgid "Our first lessons — one teacher, one family, one whiteboard."
msgstr "我们的第一堂课——一位老师，一个家庭，一块白板。"

#: core/templates/core/about.html:72
msgid "Ten teachers, three cities"
msgstr "十位老师，三个城市"

#: core/templates/core/about.html:73
msgid "Volunteers begin sharing lesson plans across borders."
msgstr "志愿者开始跨境分享课程计划。"

#: core/templates/core/about.html:79
msgid "The shared library opens"
msgstr "共享库打开"

#: core/templates/core/about.html:80
msgid "A hundred lessons published and remixed by the community."
msgstr "由社区发布和重新混合的一百个课程。"

#: core/templates/core/about.html:86
msgid "Reaching a summit — and the next one"
msgstr "登上顶峰——以及下一个顶峰"

#: core/templates/core/about.html:87
msgid "120 students, 40 volunteers, and a lot more to come."
msgstr "120 名学生、40 名志愿者以及更多其他人。"

#: core/templates/core/about.html:102
msgid "What we believe"
msgstr "我们相信什么"

#: core/templates/core/about.html:104
msgid ""
"Three ideas keep us honest — the north stars we come back to when we're "
"deciding what to build next."
msgstr "三个想法让我们保持诚实——当我们决定下一步要建造什么时，我们会回到北极星。"

#: core/templates/core/about.html:114
msgid "Learning is a right."
msgstr "学习是一种权利。"

#: core/templates/core/about.html:115
msgid "Displacement should never mean the end of an education."
msgstr "流离失所绝不意味着教育的结束。"

#: core/templates/core/about.html:123
msgid "Community over hierarchy."
msgstr "社区高于等级制度。"

#: core/templates/core/about.html:124
msgid "Every lesson gets better because someone else improved it."
msgstr "每节课都会变得更好，因为其他人改进了它。"

#: core/templates/core/about.html:131
msgid "Small steps, big summits."
msgstr "小台阶，大顶峰。"

#: core/templates/core/about.html:132
msgid "Two hours a week from many people goes a very long way."
msgstr "对于很多人来说，每周两个小时已经大有帮助了。"

#: core/templates/core/about.html:144
msgid "The team"
msgstr "团队"

#: core/templates/core/about.html:146
msgid ""
"A tiny core team keeps the lights on, but the real work happens across "
"dozens of volunteer teachers around the world."
msgstr "一个很小的核心团队负责维持工作，但真正的工作是由世界各地的数十名志愿者教师承担的。"

#: core/templates/core/about.html:153
msgid "Founder"
msgstr "创始人"

#: core/templates/core/about.html:154
msgid "Started it all at that kitchen table. Still teaches Sunday mornings."
msgstr "一切都是从厨房的桌子开始的。周日早上仍然上课。"

#: core/templates/core/about.html:159
msgid "Curriculum lead"
msgstr "课程主导"

#: core/templates/core/about.html:160
msgid "Keeps the lesson library growing and the community close."
msgstr "保持课程库的不断增长和社区的紧密联系。"

#: core/templates/core/about.html:165
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "- Student 1"
msgid "Student liaison"
msgstr "学生联络员"

#: core/templates/core/about.html:166
msgid "Was a student first. Now she helps others find their way in."
msgstr "首先是学生。现在她帮助其他人找到进入的方法。"

#: core/templates/core/about.html:171
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "Tech &amp; tools"
msgid "Tech and tools"
msgstr "技术和工具"

#: core/templates/core/about.html:172
msgid "Builds the quiet things — the drive, the dashboards, the pipes."
msgstr "建造安静的东西——驱动器、仪表板、管道。"

#: core/templates/core/about.html:184
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "Partners &amp; friends"
msgid "Partners and friends"
msgstr "合作伙伴和朋友"

#: core/templates/core/about.html:186
msgid ""
"We couldn't do this alone. These organisations help us with classroom space,"
" translation, and getting textbooks where they're needed."
msgstr "我们无法独自完成这件事。这些组织帮助我们提供教室空间、翻译以及将教科书送到需要的地方。"

#: core/templates/core/about.html:190
msgid "Partner 1"
msgstr "伙伴1"

#: core/templates/core/about.html:191
msgid "Partner 2"
msgstr "伙伴2"

#: core/templates/core/about.html:192
msgid "Partner 3"
msgstr "伙伴3"

#: core/templates/core/about.html:193
msgid "Partner 4"
msgstr "伙伴4"

#: core/templates/core/about.html:199
msgid "Want to be part of the next chapter?"
msgstr "想成为下一章的一部分吗？"

#: core/templates/core/about.html:200
msgid ""
"Whether you can teach an hour a week or just point us to someone who can — "
"we'd love to hear from you."
msgstr "无论您可以每周教一个小时，还是只是向我们推荐可以教课的人，我们都很乐意听取您的意见。"

#: core/templates/core/about.html:203
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "students learning with us"
msgid "Volunteer with us"
msgstr "和我们一起做志愿者"

#: core/templates/core/about.html:206
msgid "Say hello"
msgstr "问好"

